From: blester <blester@oreon>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] TST: only expect numexpr bool arith warning before 2.13.1

numexpr 2.13.1+ does bool +/*. pandas then does not fallback or warn.
same as pandas 2.3.x PR 62452.

